dms.machine

  ⚠ Dms tell: dms.machine
    ╭─[corpus/llm/blog/19f12335d308d0e0.md:9:1]
  8 │ 
  9 │ It started subtly. Our production monitoring system (Prometheus + Grafana) began showing a gradual increase in the memory usage of our worker process, designated "DataProcessor-1". Initially, it was just a few megabytes creeping up over several hours. We dismissed it as normal background activity – the worker was constantly processing data streams, and some overhead was expected. However, the trend persisted, and within 24 hours, the memory usage had climbed to nearly 500MB - a significant spike compared to its typical baseline of around 150MB.
    · ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    ·                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    ╰── Dms tell: dms.machine
 10 │ 
    ╰────

dms.machine

  ⚠ Dms tell: dms.machine
    ╭─[corpus/llm/blog/19f12335d308d0e0.md:11:1]
 10 │ 
 11 │ The Grafana dashboard highlighted the key metric: `process.memoryUsage()`. The ‘used’ column was steadily increasing, particularly the ‘heapUsed’ value. This immediately suggested a memory leak – something was accumulating within the process without being released. We set up an alert to trigger when `heapUsed` exceeded 75% of the worker's total memory, hoping to catch it early.
    · ────────────────────────┬────────────────────────
    ·                         ╰── Dms tell: dms.machine
 12 │ 
    ╰────

