    ╭─[corpus/llm/blog/19f12335d308d0e0.md:17:1]
 16 │ 
 17 │ Our initial hypotheses ranged from database connection issues (we weren't seeing any errors related to our database connections) to inefficient data processing logic. We considered profiling the code using tools like `node --inspect` and Chrome DevTools, but this felt premature – we needed more concrete evidence before investing significant time in detailed performance analysis.
    · ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
