 22 │ 
 23 │ Taking regular heap snapshots (every 15 minutes) allowed us to observe how the memory usage evolved over time. The first few snapshots showed a gradual increase in the number of objects allocated within the worker's heap.  We started noticing a particular pattern: a large number of objects related to our message queue – specifically, objects representing messages waiting to be processed. 
    · ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    ·                                                                                                                                                                                                    ╰── Dms tell: dms.machine
